      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i checked the headers and the auth keys seem fine. i also compared the payload to the docs and everything looks right on the surface. but when i look at the raw logs, the error just pops up out of nowhere like nothing is actually wrong with the data. is there any way to actually see what's happening internally or is the error just being vague for no reason?",
